# Line-ending policy: LF everywhere except Windows-native script types.
# Prevents CRLF from breaking shebangs (e.g. #!/usr/bin/env bun -> bun\r) when a
# repo is checked out on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) and read by Linux tools
# (Warren's Docker COPY, bwrap sandboxes, MSYS shebangs).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh  text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
